id: spirit-control-spiritual-master
name: Spiritual Master
order: 3
slot: trait
stacks: 3
description: >
  Through intense training and complete mastery, you have learned to revitalize yourself more effectively.
text: >
  Spiritual Master (3): Through intense training and complete mastery, you have learned to revitalize yourself more effectively.
  (1)-[1/Encounter]: You may use a Ki Surge as an Instant Maneuver.
  (2)-[Triggered, 2/Round]: Each time you regain Ki Points, regain 3(bT) Life Points.

---

# (1) A Ki Surge as an Instant Maneuver once an Encounter, and (2) 3(bT) Life Points each time Ki Points are regained, twice a
# Round: the table's - neither is a moment this system marks.
